{ Only Hot }
Flat White with light milk foam, and the coffee flavor will be stronger than the Latte!

{ 限冰飲 }
夏天喝最舒適的咖啡！嚴選黃檸檬，獨特香氣搭配台灣在地小農頂級龍眼蜜 ; 黃金比例調配，不酸苦！不甜膩！

{ Only Ice Drinks }
Drink the most comfortable coffee in summer! Strictly selected yellow lemon, unique aroma with Taiwan's local small farmer's top longan honey; golden ratio mix, not sour and bitter!

{ 推薦給可可愛好者 }
濃郁可可香，每一口都能享受到濃郁的咖啡與可可的味覺饗宴！！
{ Recommended for cocoa lovers }
Rich cocoa fragrance, every bite can enjoy the taste feast of rich coffee and cocoa!!

